  ====
  - [[Page~70 (4)函]]
    ==
    - To contain, to infold, to comprehend in, to envelop [[Kangxi: 容也, 函包也, 讀與含同]];
    - a letter, or what is contained in an envelop [[Kangxi: 書也]];
    - liberal, capacious;
    - _(1)p(a/)u (4)h(a/)m_
        [[baau1 haam4 包函]],
        to keep close, not to utter;
    - _(1)sh(u:) (4)h(a/)m_
        [[syu1 haam4 書函]],
        a letter;
    - _(1)ts(u:)n (4)h(a/)m_
        [[zyun1 haam4 尊函]],
        your favor;
    - _(4)h(a/)m ch(e/)ung(6)_
        [[haam4 zoeng6 函丈]]
